{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An explosive space adventure that fuses classic arcade spirit with modern bullet-hell roguelike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in the endless void, surrounded by enemies. Each wave is deadlier, each blast more spectacular. Customize your spaceship with upgraded engines, unique effects, and power-ups; dodge enemy fire with precision while unleashing your arsenal across the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense Arcade Action \u2013 Fast-paced battles that push your reflexes to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Structure \u2013 Every run is unique, with countless combinations of weapons, engines, and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosion-Focused Visuals \u2013 Colorful, retro-inspired effects that dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable Spaceship \u2013 Enhance your engines, weapons, and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Spirit Atmosphere \u2013 Neon space visuals paired with immersive electronic music.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074700?t=1764874115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/548ac54895f0d3bc01b542bb7454a718b14b7f1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764874115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/0ea5ba04651ac5713165a30ad6bb0ea33d9c2de7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764874115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074700/0ea5ba04651ac5713165a30ad6bb0ea33d9c2de7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764874115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","i